9:["$","p",null,{"children":["To stop infinite delegation (A → B → A → B → ...), the run loop tracks every agent visited during a run: handing off to an already-visited agent throws ",["$","code",null,{"children":"HandoffLoopError"}],", and a hard ",["$","code",null,{"children":"maxHandoffs"}]," cap (default 5, override via"," ",["$","code",null,{"children":["runAgent(client, agent, input, ","{"," maxHandoffs: 10 ","}",")"]}],") catches runaway delegation even across distinct agents. Both are wrapped in an ",["$","code",null,{"children":"AgentRunError"}]," that also carries the trace collected up to the point of failure:"]}]
